WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:06.861
Meet UX Job Plan, a free toolkit that gives your design
job search a clear next step, every week.

2
00:00:07.348 --> 00:00:11.508
Open a task to see what to do, how much time to budget,
and where to start.

3
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.001
Check it off, then review what moved forward and what
still needs time.

4
00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:23.559
Build your skills with focused courses, then put what you
learn to work in portfolio case studies.

5
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:30.744
Build your resume and LinkedIn profile. Paste a posting
into Resume Tailor to see which keywords your resume
covers.

6
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:36.721
Rehearse for interviews, then log each application so you
know where it stands and what to do next.

7
00:00:38.577 --> 00:00:43.505
Plan networking and events, and save useful reads from
What's New straight to your library.

8
00:00:45.619 --> 00:00:53.235
Make the plan yours in Settings. On supported desktop
Chrome, optional AI runs on your device. No account
required.
